The [[Strong Stone Skin Potion]] is a neutral [[Potion]] normally obtained by combining a [[Stone Skin Potion]] with two [[Stone]]s, although [[Reaper]]s can also catalytically convert the [[Stone Skin Potion]] to the [[Strong Stone Skin Potion]] with the [[Cauldron]]. When the player reaches 45 {{icon/block}}, it will be consumed and convert some health into a greater amount of {{icon/block}}, and give some temporary {{icon/spikes}}, as well as apply the effect of the above [[Potion]]. The health conversion cannot kill the player and will leave them with at least 1 health left. If not enough health was left for the full effect, it will give 2x the health that it could convert into {{icon/block}}.

At worst, it raises the player's effective HP and deals some {{icon/spikes}} damage, as long as the 45 {{icon/block}} condition will reliably be met.

As even basic [[Leather Armor]] generates 45 {{icon/block}} at battle start, a [[Stone Skin Potion]] or [[Strong Stone Skin Potion]] can be used to immediately trigger any other potion immediately at the start of battle, if tactically relevant.

